# ─── SLR Engine — environment template ────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to `.env` and fill in YOUR OWN values. Commit ONLY this file (variable
# names, no values). Never commit a real `.env` or any key.
#
# For the MDPI-public release, `.env` is OPTIONAL: the offline public
# verification (`slr-engine verify-public`) needs no keys, network, or data.
# Live/restricted stages additionally require an external data root supplied
# at runtime (never in the repo).

# ── Paths (all optional; defaults are safe) ───────────────────────────────
# Root where an AUTHORIZED researcher supplies restricted data from outside
# the repo (raw exports, API caches, PDFs). Must point outside the Git
# worktree. See docs/restricted-data.md.
# SLR_DATA_ROOT=/secure/restricted-study-vault

# Override the pipeline's output tree (isolated, non-destructive runs).
# SLR_OUTPUT_DIR=/path/to/scratch-output

# Local acl-anthology repo clone (metadata only). If empty, acl-anthology
# auto-clones to a platform cache (~500 MB) — that cache is external.
# ACL_DATA_DIR=

# ── API keys (for live retrieval only — never required offline) ───────────
# SCOPUS_API_KEY=
# WOS_API_KEY=
# IEEE_API_KEY=
# SEMANTIC_SCHOLAR_API_KEY=

# ── LLM triage (optional screening aid) ───────────────────────────────────
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=
# LLM_SCREEN_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5-20251001

# ── TLS/SSL ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Set to 0 to disable SSL verification (institutional proxies only).
# REQUESTS_SSL_VERIFY=1
